{
  "id": "745",
  "title": "Are You Alright?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-07-06",
  "synopsis": "Ben is worried about Lili, but she’s fine.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1087/4da5bdabedec23c84cbf24a7c8c8fc03f758d32f.mp3?1561664817",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 6: Maybe I Like Him",
    "chapter": 9,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你还好吗？\n\n丽丽：这么晚了，你怎么跑来了？\n本：丽丽，你还好吗？\n丽丽：我很好啊！你怎么没穿鞋？\n本：你真的还好吗？\n丽丽：我真的很好啊！你怎么了？\n本：那就好！你没事就好！我做梦，梦到你被杀了。\n丽丽：哈哈，本！那只是梦。\n本：你没事就好。很晚了，那我回去了。再见！\n丽丽：再见！",
    "traditional": "你還好嗎？\n\n麗麗：這麼晚了，你怎麼跑來了？\n本：麗麗，你還好嗎？\n麗麗：我很好啊！你怎麼沒穿鞋？\n本：你真的還好嗎？\n麗麗：我真的很好啊！你怎麼了？\n本：那就好！你沒事就好！我做夢，夢到你被殺了。\n麗麗：哈哈，本！那只是夢。\n本：你沒事就好。很晚了，那我回去了。再見！\n麗麗：再見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are You Alright?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：这么晚了，你怎么跑来了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：這麼晚了，你怎麼跑來了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zhè me wǎn le nǐ zěn me pǎo lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: It’s so late, why do you come running?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，你还好吗？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，你還好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì nǐ hái hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, are you alright?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我很好啊！你怎么没穿鞋？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我很好啊！你怎麼沒穿鞋？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ hěn hǎo a nǐ zěn me méi chuān xié",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I am very well! Why aren’t you wearing shoes?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：你真的还好吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你真的還好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ zhēn de hái hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Are you really alright?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我真的很好啊！你怎么了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我真的很好啊！你怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zhēn de hěn hǎo a nǐ zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I am really very well! What’s going on with you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：那就好！你没事就好！我做梦，梦到你被杀了。",
      "traditional": "本：那就好！你沒事就好！我做夢，夢到你被殺了。",
      "pinyin": "běn nà jiù hǎo nǐ méi shì jiù hǎo wǒ zuò mèng mèng dào nǐ bèi shā le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then it’s Ok! If you’re out of danger then it’s Ok! I had a dream, and dreamed that you were killed."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哈哈，本！那只是梦。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哈哈，本！那只是夢。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hā hā běn nà zhǐ shì mèng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Haha, Ben! That was only a dream."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：你没事就好。很晚了，那我回去了。再见！",
      "traditional": "本：你沒事就好。很晚了，那我回去了。再見！",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ méi shì jiù hǎo hěn wǎn le nà wǒ huí qù le zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: If you’re alright then it’s Ok. It’s very late, so I’ll go back. See you later!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：再见！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：再見！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: See you later!"
    }
  ],
